{
 "title": "Lambda 表达式",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "对于小任务，不必另写一个 `fn`，可以写一个匿名的 **lambda**：`fn(参数) -> 返回类型 => 表达式`。它可以存进变量，也可以直接作为参数传入。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn transform(items: [3]i32, func: fn(i32) -> i32):",
    "    for x in items:",
    "        print(func(x))",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    nums: [3]i32 = [1, 2, 3]",
    "    transform(nums, fn(x: i32) -> i32 => x * x)",
    "    adder = fn(a: i32, b: i32) -> i32 => a + b",
    "    print(\"sum:\", adder(10, 20))"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "1",
    "4",
    "9",
    "sum: 30"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "在不返回值的 lambda 中，省略返回类型，并且函数体必须是一个调用表达式："
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn main():",
    "    logger = fn(s: str) => print(\"[LOG]\", s)",
    "    logger(\"the lambda ran\")"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "[LOG] the lambda ran"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c09-l03-x1",
   "prompt": "用 `transform` 配合一个给每个数字加 10 的 lambda，并输出结果（对 `[1, 2, 3]` 是 11、12、13）。",
   "starter": [
    "fn transform(items: [3]i32, func: fn(i32) -> i32):",
    "    for x in items:",
    "        print(func(x))",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    nums: [3]i32 = [1, 2, 3]",
    "    transform(nums, fn(x: i32) -> i32 => x)"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "fn transform(items: [3]i32, func: fn(i32) -> i32):",
    "    for x in items:",
    "        print(func(x))",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    nums: [3]i32 = [1, 2, 3]",
    "    transform(nums, fn(x: i32) -> i32 => x + 10)"
   ],
   "hint": "让 lambda 的函数体为 `x + 10`。",
   "expected": [
    "11",
    "12",
    "13"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c09-l03-q1",
   "q": "`fn(x: i32) -> i32 => x * 2` 是什么？",
   "options": [
    "一个结构体",
    "一个把输入乘以二的匿名函数（lambda）",
    "一个错误"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "`=>` 开始 lambda 的函数体。"
  }
 ]
}
